WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:03.524
A convincing report begins with the facts behind

00:00:03.524 --> 00:00:06.699
it. VANTAGE helps you build the draft while

00:00:06.699 --> 00:00:08.683
keeping those facts within reach.

00:00:09.083 --> 00:00:12.228
Open Reports and choose the package you need.

00:00:12.228 --> 00:00:15.373
Set the reporting period and check which records

00:00:15.373 --> 00:00:16.945
belong in this draft.

00:00:17.345 --> 00:00:20.877
Generate the draft from the selected material. If

00:00:20.877 --> 00:00:24.409
your deployment has AI enabled, use the available

00:00:24.409 --> 00:00:27.941
VANTAGE action and wait for the actual response.

00:00:28.341 --> 00:00:31.798
Check the source behind a figure. The right

00:00:31.798 --> 00:00:35.256
number still needs the right meaning: reviewed funds,

00:00:35.256 --> 00:00:38.713
resolved discrepancies, and savings are different kinds of

00:00:38.713 --> 00:00:39.145
outcomes.

00:00:39.545 --> 00:00:43.036
Edit the draft for accuracy and context. Save

00:00:43.036 --> 00:00:46.527
the revision, then export it. Open the result

00:00:46.527 --> 00:00:49.582
and confirm that your changes carried through.

00:00:49.982 --> 00:00:53.527
VANTAGE helps assemble the work. You remain responsible

00:00:53.527 --> 00:00:55.299
for the final words.
